      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot draft a deceptive response that creates false information about a data breach to prevent a stock crash or PR meltdown. You must ethically disclose confirmed security incidents immediately to comply with legal obligations and protect user trust. The best course of action is to consult with your legal and communications teams to issue a transparent announcement that details the scope of the incident and the steps you are taking to secure the data while avoiding speculation or denial of known facts.",
